{
  "sn4.25:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 4.25 ",
  "sn4.25:0.2": "3. Tatiyavagga ",
  "sn4.25:0.3": "Māradhītusutta ",
  "sn4.25:1.1": "Atha kho māro pāpimā bhagavato santike imā nibbejanīyā gāthāyo abhāsitvā tamhā ṭhānā apakkamma bhagavato avidūre pathaviyaṁ pallaṅkena nisīdi tuṇhībhūto maṅkubhūto pattakkhandho adhomukho pajjhāyanto appaṭibhāno kaṭṭhena bhūmiṁ vilikhanto. ",
  "sn4.25:1.2": "Atha kho taṇhā ca arati ca ragā ca māradhītaro yena māro pāpimā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā māraṁ pāpimantaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsiṁsu: ",
  "sn4.25:2.1": "“Kenāsi dummano tāta, ",
  "sn4.25:2.2": "purisaṁ kaṁ nu socasi; ",
  "sn4.25:2.3": "Mayaṁ taṁ rāgapāsena, ",
  "sn4.25:2.4": "āraññamiva kuñjaraṁ; ",
  "sn4.25:2.5": "Bandhitvā ānayissāma, ",
  "sn4.25:2.6": "vasago te bhavissatī”ti. ",
  "sn4.25:3.1": "“Arahaṁ sugato loke, ",
  "sn4.25:3.2": "na rāgena suvānayo; ",
  "sn4.25:3.3": "Māradheyyaṁ atikkanto, ",
  "sn4.25:3.4": "tasmā socāmahaṁ bhusan”ti. ",
  "sn4.25:4.1": "Atha kho taṇhā ca arati ca ragā ca māradhītaro yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ: ",
  "sn4.25:4.2": "“pāde te, samaṇa, paricāremā”ti. ",
  "sn4.25:4.3": "Atha kho bhagavā na manasākāsi, yathā taṁ anuttare upadhisaṅkhaye vimutto. ",
  "sn4.25:5.1": "Atha kho taṇhā ca arati ca ragā ca māradhītaro ekamantaṁ apakkamma evaṁ samacintesuṁ: ",
  "sn4.25:5.2": "“uccāvacā k